WEBVTT

1
00:00:06,450 --> 00:00:08,990
Senior Brother Wang, I am not simple.

2
00:00:09,230 --> 00:00:10,270
Brother Wang is offended

3
00:00:10,270 --> 00:00:11,390
Just saying to Senior Brother Wang

4
00:00:11,390 --> 00:00:13,910
My posture is not as good as that of Hou San, which is a bit inconsistent.

5
00:00:13,910 --> 00:00:14,950
So I want to compare

6
00:00:14,950 --> 00:00:16,750
You are not good

7
00:00:16,750 --> 00:00:17,950
Just for my sisters

8
00:00:17,950 --> 00:00:18,950
How do you want to compare?

9
00:00:18,950 --> 00:00:20,390
How do you compare with Senior Sister Ji?

10
00:00:20,390 --> 00:00:21,910
How can I compare with Hou San?

11
00:00:21,910 --> 00:00:22,910
We agreed that after seven days

12
00:00:22,910 --> 00:00:24,750
A duel in the ring determines who owns the job

13
00:00:24,750 --> 00:00:26,110
Just one session will destroy me

14
00:00:26,110 --> 00:00:28,110
Dare you compare yourself to my second-term lord?

15
00:00:28,110 --> 00:00:29,310
Still hoping to win

16
00:00:29,310 --> 00:00:31,950
If you can stand up and get off the ring, you are considered great.

17
00:00:31,950 --> 00:00:35,350
But I can't wait for seven days and three days at most.

18
00:00:35,350 --> 00:00:36,550
How dare you bully my junior brother?

19
00:00:36,630 --> 00:00:37,630
Ji Yuntong

20
00:00:37,630 --> 00:00:39,590
This is what he wants to compare with if he doesn't dare

21
00:00:39,590 --> 00:00:41,070
You can obediently give up your work.

22
00:00:41,070 --> 00:00:42,310
It's just about today

23
00:00:42,310 --> 00:00:43,710
It doesn't sound good if word gets out.

24
00:00:43,710 --> 00:00:44,710
if i win

25
00:00:44,710 --> 00:00:45,870
What should you do?

26
00:00:45,870 --> 00:00:46,830
if you win

27
00:00:46,830 --> 00:00:52,230
Why is it not enough if I give you a fourth-term elixir?

28
00:00:52,230 --> 00:00:54,110
I want two fourth-level elixirs

29
00:00:54,110 --> 00:00:56,710
And you have to give me the flaming rope mark on your hand too.

30
00:00:56,710 --> 00:00:57,630
Then you lose

31
00:00:57,630 --> 00:00:58,910
You must announce it to me in public

32
00:00:58,910 --> 00:01:00,230
Be my lover

33
00:01:00,230 --> 00:01:01,590
Become a cow or a horse for me
